{
  "name": "inbox_suggest",
  "description": "Submit the event's recap and one suggestion (replaces any earlier). Nothing goes out until the user confirms, then it runs verbatim. `kind` `reply`: send-ready text in the user's voice (no 【…】 blanks; omit unknowns, say why in `note`; to @ someone where supported (Feishu): `mentions` (`id` from member search, exact `name`) and `@name` in `text`; bare `@name` is plain text; Feishu sheet/Base `changes`: ref, field, listed value); `agent`: new Agent instruction in `text` (`machine`, `cwd` optional); `handoff`: to this manager's main, active leader or linked task chat (`machine`, `session`; note in `text`; processing chat only; not archived, unknown or other-manager targets); `todo`: action-led title in `text`, `due` only for a stated deadline (`2006-01-02` all day or RFC 3339 with offset; if unsure omit, say why); confirming files it; `conclusion`: dealt with, `text` conclusion, `outcome` `fyi` or `done`. `handback: true` returns confirmation here as an instruction for user judgment. Every call: `recap` (background, progress, blockers; ≤600 chars), `title` (ignored for mail, docs, PRs/issues) and `summary` (1 sentence: state, who waits); titles name no chats or people. `note`: 1-2 sentences of findings/evidence. `related`: item ids in other chats/sources. Only without `kind` (no suggestion) may `follow` await the other side: `who` (empty = their reply), `next`, `check_at` (RFC 3339, zoned) or `check_in` (e.g. `4h`, `2d`; default `24h`, clamped 30m-14d). `reported` `{text, by}`: one done external action the program didn't see (not plans; `by` `agent`|`assistant` (default); one line ≤120 chars; not on filed items; deduped against the last). Call at end of turn. In a handed-off chat (context has the event id), `item` writes back (also a card); not for unhanded or filed items.",
  "input_schema": {
    "type": "object",
    "properties": {
      "processing_turn": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "item": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "kind": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": [
          "reply",
          "agent",
          "handoff",
          "conclusion",
          "todo"
        ]
      },
      "text": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "note": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "handback": {
        "type": "boolean"
      },
      "outcome": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": [
          "fyi",
          "done"
        ]
      },
      "recap": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "reported": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "text"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "text": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "by": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "agent",
              "assistant"
            ],
            "default": "assistant"
          }
        }
      },
      "title": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "summary": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "follow": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "who": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "next": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "check_at": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          },
          "check_in": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      },
      "machine": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "session": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "cwd": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "due": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "related": {
        "type": "array",
        "items": {
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "mentions": {
        "type": "array",
        "maxItems": 100,
        "items": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": [
            "id",
            "name"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "id": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "name": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "changes": {
        "type": "array",
        "items": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "ref",
            "field",
            "value"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "ref": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "field": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "value": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
